Ledger and Ledlight produce the same included interval balances.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --from 2024-01-01 --to 2024-01-31 --accounts '*Assets:*' --accounts '*Expenses:*'

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager --sort account --begin 2024-01-01 --end 2024-02-01 balance --flat --no-total --format '%12(display_total)  %(account)\n' '^Assets:' '^Expenses:'

========== FILE ==========

commodity EUR
  default
  format 1,000.00 EUR
account Assets:Bank
account Equity:Opening
account Expenses:Food
account Income:Salary
account Expenses:Utilities

include entries/*.ledger

========== FILE entries/2024-02.ledger ==========

2024-02-01 Salary
  Assets:Bank  2300 EUR
  Income:Salary

2024-02-10 Utilities
  Expenses:Utilities  110.55 EUR
  Assets:Bank

========== FILE entries/2024-01.ledger ==========

2024-01-05 Bank | Opening balance
  Assets:Bank  1500.25 EUR
  Equity:Opening

2024-01-20 Groceries
  Expenses:Food  75.20 EUR
  Assets:Bank

========== OUTPUT ==========

1,425.05 EUR  Assets:Bank
   75.20 EUR  Expenses:Food
